    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As a SmartTools map user",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I want to view the details of a Download point",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "So that I can investigate download performance at the selected location.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Issue/Change Description:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When a user opens a Download point through the shared point-detail dialog, show the test summary, a time-series chart, and the returned per-sample data."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The test summary includes the reported technology, user, handset, service, serving cell, duration, tested technologies, indoor/outdoor status, Download Rate, and Wi-Fi connection status. The chart shows signal strength and Download Rate over the test duration. Where returned, display Average Signal Strength, Average Signal Quality, and Average SNR immediately after Download Rate."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Point selection, dialog behaviour, and the mini-map are covered by the preceding shared stories."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance Criteria:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given a completed Download test is selected, its summary shows the available test and device information, including Download Rate and Wi-Fi connection status."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given Download samples are available, a time-series chart shows Signal Strength in dBm and Download Rate in Mbps over the test duration."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given per-sample data is available, it is displayed in a sortable and filterable table with the relevant units."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given average signal metrics are returned, Average Signal Strength, Average Signal Quality, and Average SNR appear immediately after Download Rate."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given the selected Download point has no measurable duration, the user receives the standard no-data state rather than an empty detail view."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given Download details are loading, unavailable, or fail to load, a standard loading, no-data, or error state is shown without displaying incorrect data."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "rule"
        },
